WoWFA_En[196718] = "Summons darkness around you in a$?a357419[ 12 yd][n 8 yd] radius, granting friendly targets a $209426s2% chance to avoid all damage from an attack. Lasts $d.\n\nChance to avoid damage increased by $s3% when not in a raid."
