WoWFA_En[198793] = "Remove all snares and vault away. Nearby enemies take $198813s2 Physical damage$?s320635[ and have their movement speed reduced by $198813s1% for $198813d][].$?a203551[\n\n|cFFFFFFFFGenerates ${($203650s1/5)*$203650d} Fury over $203650d if you damage an enemy.|r][]"
